+| FR-001 | Initialize unique items as pending and unselected without mutation | AC-1, AC-4 | Critical |
+| FR-002 | Toggle only a known item selection without mutation | AC-2, AC-4 | Critical |
+| FR-003 | Confirm only selected items, clear selection, and no-op on empty selection | AC-3 | Critical |
